[00:20.60]1. God has a new creation,
[00:24.82]His spirit-anointed sons.
[00:29.52]He has bought them from mankind;
[00:34.12]His approval they’ve won.
[00:38.78](Chorus)
[00:39.08]A special possession,
[00:43.96]They’re a people for your name.
[00:48.78]They love you. They praise you.
[00:54.46]As one they declare abroad your fame.
[01:12.11]2. They are a holy nation,
[01:16.33]Who handle the truth aright.
[01:20.65]God has called them from darkness
[01:25.43]To his wonderful light.
[01:31.41](Chorus)
[01:32.87]A special possession,
[01:37.57]They’re a people for your name.
[01:42.73]They love you. They praise you.
[01:47.65]As one they declare abroad your fame.
[01:56.49]3. Faithful to their commission,
[01:58.17]They gather the other sheep.
[01:58.17]To the Lamb they are loyal.
[01:58.17]His commandments they keep.
[02:26.99](Chorus)
[02:29.81]A special possession,
[02:33.65]They’re a people for your name.
[02:38.91]They love you. They praise you.
[02:43.95]As one they declare abroad your fame.
